
The system documentation is in the docs directory of the multiverse repository.


Build the Cosmos binary RPM and SRPM locally for AlmaLinux 10:

    make cosmos-rpm

The build needs Docker with Buildx and access to the AlmaLinux package
repositories. It exports the unsigned noarch RPM and its matching source RPM
to build/cosmos-rpm/ after the installed-package checks pass. The signed
packages and their public key are in rpm/. See docs/cosmos-rpm.md.

For Debian or AlmaLinux 10 host enrollment, see docs/enrollment.md.
